{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在夏威夷猝逝的黃大煒（David）震驚各界，眾多星友紛紛透過社交平台悼念，杜德偉跟他相識超過20年，悲痛心情難以平復，難過表示「他是華語樂壇難得一見的英雄人物」。曾在節目中與他合唱的林宥嘉、閻奕格同樣感到震驚，閻奕格感慨說「能夠遇見您，是一件很幸運的事」。</p><p>杜德偉想起初次聽見黃大煒的名字，是1990年時經由同事推薦：</p><p>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深：</p><figure><img alt=\"杜德偉與黃大煒（Facebook＠杜德偉 Alex To）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143204988768489472940581.jpeg/3qJfFfIC7bSa7tSsT3d2jMAQ3ChERjDvKUiP2SlIj9k\"/><figcaption>杜德偉與黃大煒（Facebook＠杜德偉 Alex To）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207203868512256345790.jpeg/Z3IKBRDo9Vsjnl7e-D2CADYEUUUzXLIRx1l1jMdZdYw\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207206242619392612057.jpeg/moGC20x3r2kqOMMLuVdwIxpRSS3JhnpocNTCqnDUwqo\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207208541229056490273.jpeg/D6r4StmMKlBGBEmfZbVGia9A5xP2x1JyMyNuYDMjbmA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207210613346304058761.jpeg/_78jb7MkNnSo7i_Yk9Nf1gRjbX4g0wUNler8ApXq_AI\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207212907761664592367.jpeg/u-RmJsA06oZ-HvxJC031iHyeWNkvBnDe7I7DBuyOwwY\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207203704934400184327.jpeg/Vr3Sc83SuLyBhSrmuuyY4BZnCL9yqXmBPTwJPT08CT0\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207205844160512053789.jpeg/WrhizutAGib3jHcnW70SStWjDEvt-wEJmKesw5inrMM\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友Vicky與許多藝人交情頗深（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒與林宥嘉（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138406524522496054823.jpeg/YLl0-DwfQ_khUNnbvizM0U_S_BB_cZYq7l1Psu5dT7I\"/><figcaption>黃大煒與林宥嘉（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky與鄧紫棋（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138405182345216736029.jpeg/g0NS6x3eh7q_ToYMJt7mQnmFz4w7a0L5_cMJLf3DCS0\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky與鄧紫棋（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><p>後來熟識的兩人分享音樂，黃大煒充滿熱忱的模樣仍讓他印象深刻，「當時數字錄音正要盛行，他像個分享新玩具的孩子，新專輯中的一首歌錄了滿滿兩百多條音軌，人聲、樂器、和聲樣本全在其中。對我那時還是以現場表演為主的歌手來說，這既震撼，也極具啟發」。</p><p>閻奕格在《超級星光大道：星光傳奇賽》中，跟擔任評審的黃大煒搭檔合唱，表現獲得滿堂彩，她難過地說：「是您教我活在當下，擁抱未知，也懂得去珍惜那些微小卻美好的時刻。」她很感謝黃大煒持續給予大家無私的愛，「我會非常、非常想念您。大煒老師，一路好走，願您安息」。</p><p>林宥嘉昨天忙於工作，收工後獲知噩耗哀痛至極，透過所屬華研表示「聽到這個消息很難過」，也在IG分享與黃大煒的合照。他3年前邀請黃大煒擔任「idol」巡演嘉賓，在小巨蛋飆唱「你把我灌醉」，重現過往在「超級星光大道」合唱的片段，那時黃大煒作為評審，把第一個滿分給了林宥嘉，他很感謝恩師願意助陣，「謝謝黃大煒老師，他是我人生第一個合唱的歌手」。</p><figure><img alt=\"鄧紫棋發文哀悼黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143207507234131968952781.png/_J_6jCL2p2DltLmL4cIWpfUq-uM1GjTNZP1i82T9YvM\"/><figcaption>鄧紫棋發文哀悼黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><p>另外，鄧紫棋也受到「你把我灌醉」一曲影響，曾在節目上告白稱黃大煒活出她的理想人生，期許自己能像他一樣一生都熱愛音樂，無奈迎來生離死別，她在IG悼念：</p><p>更難忘先前現場聽到黃大煒唱歌，自己淚流滿面的那一刻。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：舒淇發聲悼念黃大煒驟逝　曬前輩生前燦爛笑容照　四字追念惹鼻酸】舒淇發文悼念黃大煒。（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143139631366148096348725.jpeg/nnqaXd-zDTVX0WYS9uhBZ0lWSdLXSgXibnyrrW58q60\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：舒淇發聲悼念黃大煒驟逝　曬前輩生前燦爛笑容照　四字追念惹鼻酸】舒淇發文悼念黃大煒。（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（東申未來微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250920/1046118158077267968678024.jpeg/zPZt8VZUcG9hz3npW_FPXFvNOVKXSajjbycaVW8nGlU\"/><figcaption>舒淇（東申未來微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250929/1049393426858250240168359.jpeg/2HLWilBExPozhRux_TdDRTZMkouWmad_zWY4p81mOKc\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258713970511872501697.jpeg/W7zNrDzfG4G59TtWyZVtOWXhm9PCfDC_Gu35Lxrt-S8\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394855004934144018239.jpeg/1INksstPSR5uLDBYBeeWUuggYelbBhnySu9TAUrvUwE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394861372280832390781.jpeg/X0hZn1MWzGiIFDlandoSqdpW60BRowfsHvG28h7xtvI\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251017/1055990773616480256418306.jpeg/2m6xQhWB20sHyOPQXGJrk2h-_ZMs0CpTuGJ0vbhidL0\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121781498098618368504932.jpeg/qBOHvXbtTU7XAoCl9CkdGP6Jvcj_MuykJ09CpCdPQqQ\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394859434381312781249.jpeg/HLahv6lBCzK9jxGT7Ih1wIrADTm4N-rDf7ak8X-2pPE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241219/946377698203668480483256.jpeg/Nr8iF25d7Iu3b3m3mEX4pDW-RR0LAStW8qUzKfKlMyk\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251017/1055990782303408128768309.jpeg/-6qXiDz_qEmiqFIOIJtXrCB16VWf8mZCEo8cahKPHGo\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258718873915392352164.jpeg/PpGoElGc00-xt90o6LTF81hvl7YlFoAR1B6me9Qepns\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250121/958406407332433920952476.jpeg/eKvRxfa-5Esj_M3Df_O8oP_HKU8UbKIt7mIqge5iKoE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258715652689920763294.jpeg/W4ozKtPcg6bAwo9SdP1uyfChmEb1dwEOqcoKyKnKCsg\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><p>寶寶暴動了！蔡依林神還原「招牌動作」彈指舞 回憶殺掀全場驚聲尖叫</p><p>「我都真的唱」疑嗆爆五月天 冰球樂團道歉了：管好自己的嘴</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T13:45:21.794207+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1511,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}